    "enUS": {
      "description": "We got them held prisoner, {race}. I'm talking about their Wing Commanders. It was a furious battle in the skies but they finally fell! Unfortunately, our best pilots were shot down in a counterattack against Frostwolf Keep. You gotta find out what happened to them.\n\nSearch Tower Point West and Frostwolf Keep. These were their last known locations. Search these areas thoroughly.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Ichman's Location Discovered",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Vipore's Location Discovered",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Slidore's Location Discovered",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Travel to Frostwolf territory and search for Wing Commander Slidore, Wing Commander Vipore, and Wing Commander Ichman. Return to Commander Duffy should you complete your mission.",
